    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as monster in this puzzle platformer with no jump ability. Move from one room to another, killing all adventurers by your self or using traps on the level. Explore, eat, escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/4fe5641a0225e7e0881e2538134fe9f7.poster.avif?t=1755107863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/4fe5641a0225e7e0881e2538134fe9f7.webm?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/4fe5641a0225e7e0881e2538134fe9f7.mp4?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as monster: Adventurers will run away in terror when you come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No-Jump-Puzzles: Play classic platformer levels without ability to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeon: avoid dangerous traps or turn them to your advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/1100d33e26b372324bd238bcb3990725.poster.avif?t=1755107863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/1100d33e26b372324bd238bcb3990725.webm?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/1100d33e26b372324bd238bcb3990725.mp4?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as monster in this puzzle platformer with no jump ability. Move from one room to another, killing all adventurers by your self or using traps on the level. Explore, eat, escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/4fe5641a0225e7e0881e2538134fe9f7.poster.avif?t=1755107863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/4fe5641a0225e7e0881e2538134fe9f7.webm?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/4fe5641a0225e7e0881e2538134fe9f7.mp4?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as monster: Adventurers will run away in terror when you come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No-Jump-Puzzles: Play classic platformer levels without ability to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeon: avoid dangerous traps or turn them to your advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/1100d33e26b372324bd238bcb3990725.poster.avif?t=1755107863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/1100d33e26b372324bd238bcb3990725.webm?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555480/extras/1100d33e26b372324bd238bcb3990725.mp4?t=1755107863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
